Bolt is plain code: scripts/bolt.py on bolt-cycle.timer. No agent is woken,
so there is no AGENTS.md to build and no OpenClaw registration to check.
Since 2026-10-16 his second book, Bolt + news, asks the plan one question
at a time (wake.py ask, haiku, at most 5 a day) - a question, not an agent
with instructions. preflight.py and deploy.sh read this file; delete it only
if a model ever runs Bolt's cycle.
